   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "id": "50dccfda",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 6. K-Nearest Neighbors (KNN)\n",
    "Paper Table II: `metric = 'minkowski'`, `leaf_size = 20`\n",
    "\n",
    "The paper does not give `n_neighbors`, so we use the scikit-learn default **K = 5**.\n",
    "\n",
    "KNN uses distances, so scaling is important. `MinMaxScaler` is applied inside the pipeline."
