    "## 7. SVM (optional third model)\n",
    "Paper Table II: `kernel = 'rbf'`, `gamma = 'scale'`\n",
    "\n",
    "**Note:** In Table II the row name is *\"SVM - Linear Kernel\"*, but the listed setting is `kernel: 'rbf'`. The name and the setting do not agree. We follow the **listed hyperparameters** (RBF kernel) and report this as an unclear point in the paper.\n",
    "\n",
    "SVM also uses distances, so `MinMaxScaler` is applied inside the pipeline."
