    "1. Install `imbalanced-learn` (not in `requirements.txt` yet).\n",
    "2. Apply SMOTE **only to the training data**, after the split. Never to the test data.\n",
    "3. Train the same three models again on the balanced training data and save a second predictions file.\n",
    "\n",
